// profile: step=one
// Two receives that fire once (<-) race for one datum.  A receive that fires
// once is in the store until it fires, as in f1r3lang, so the one that loses
// is still waiting at the end: the row rho_LINE_COLUMN!().
token!(1) |
for ($x <- token) { got!(a, $x) } |
for ($x <- token) { got!(b, $x) }
